Builds without desktop notifications, such as Termux, fail with -Werror
because the notification stub leaves its target parameter unused. The fix
is on dev after v1.0.0-beta.1; remove this patch when the recipe moves to
a later tag.

diff --git a/src/platform/linux/notifications.c b/src/platform/linux/notifications.c
index 1cb42ce..61b827a 100644
--- a/src/platform/linux/notifications.c
+++ b/src/platform/linux/notifications.c
@@ -488,6 +488,7 @@ void desktop_queue(desktop_notifier *n, const char *key, const char *title, cons
     (void)key;
     (void)title;
     (void)body;
+    (void)target;
 }
 void desktop_cancel(desktop_notifier *n, const char *key)
 {
